# externals
/external/unowinreg/unowinreg.dll

# VS2008 CRT redistributable — user-supplied, see external/msvcp90/README_msvcX90.dll.
# Only the Microsoft-shipped binaries and their assembly manifests are ignored;
# the first-party Bazel build files in that directory (BUILD.bazel, the
# vc90_app*.manifest application manifests and the .rc files that embed them)
# ARE tracked.  This was a blanket /external/msvcp90/* until 2026-08-01, which
# silently kept those build files out of the repo.
/external/msvcp90/*.dll
/external/msvcp90/amd64/*.dll
/external/msvcp90/Microsoft.VC90.CRT.manifest
/external/msvcp90/amd64/Microsoft.VC90.CRT.manifest
/external/msvcp90/Microsoft.VC90.DebugCRT.manifest

